<title>USA: Pacific Telesis Group Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Pacific Telesis Group Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dec. 31, 1996     Q4     Dec. 31, 1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.45   profit	 $0.54</p>
<p> Net	 profit     191,000   profit     231,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,449,000		2,282,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 428,318		  428,431</p>
<p>					    YEAR</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $2.67     loss	 $5.43</p>
<p> Net	 profit   1,142,000     loss   2,312,000</p>
<p> Revs		   9,588,000		9,042,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 428,388		  425,996</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Year ended Dec. 31, 1996 includes a one-time gain from an accounting change of $85 million, or $0.20/shr.</p>
<p>Year ended Dec. 31, 1995 includes a one-time charge of $3.36 billion or $7.89/shr.</p>
<p>Excluding the effects of one-time items, Year 1996 net profit was $2.47/shr vs a net profit of $2.46 in Year 1995.</p>
</text>
